828)錄得74.4、16.2及8.1億元淨買入。小米(1810)、建設銀行(939)及華虹宏力(1347)錄得9.1、4.0及3.9億元淨賣出。11月以來累積淨買入約281億元，10月淨賣出約280億元。 恒指跌1.1%，成份股31升62跌2持平。京東(9618)及華潤啤酒(291)漲逾3%，為升幅最大藍籌。百濟神州(6160)及中生製藥(1177)升逾2%。農夫山泉(9633)及銀河娛樂(27)升逾1%。華虹宏力(1347)及寧德時代(3750)跌逾17%及12%，為跌幅最大藍籌。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["金融"],"bull":["目標價","增持"],"bear":[],"score":3,"highlights":[],"keywords":["香港","港股","元志峰"]},"time":"11/26 04:50"},{"id":"7458ddab69708232","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《一週外資買超53-14》FB科技(1852)、潤 弘(1810)","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQOHozWTRmakNPN0xOajhZYkxmNHNlaEl2VHJqbDRteGk1WWR2WEh5bFJBRDJ3MmxTQ05Uak5oODRBaWZCcU9zOGRfa1hHcG4wUTRqZ2hPR3J2SDBKNzhVa18xR20yV0tkMzdxdEUxRlUwaURzSk1mbzFJSkYyRkNJMkhBX1FWUllO?oc=5","published":1795390680,"summary":"《一週外資買超53-14》FB科技(1852)、潤 弘(1810) 富聯網","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向"],"bull":["買超"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/23 07:38"}],"fund":{"code":"1810","rev_month":"11510","rev":362646.0,"rev_mom":3.1170027638448152,"rev_yoy":3.7907733521083227,"rev_cum_yoy":-4.404677526200108,"eps_q":3.59,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"3","net_income":1076908.0,"pe":4.76,"pb":0.61,"yield":1.17,"updated":"2026-11-27 02:23"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-11-20","big1000":57.77,"big400":63.25,"retail":16.05,"holders":22354},"prev":{"date":"2026-11-13","big1000":58.56,"big400":63.17,"retail":16.17,"holders":22527},"d_big1000":-0.79,"d_big400":0.08,"d_retail":-0.12,"d_holders":-173},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":27.6,"high":27.85,"low":23.0,"close":24.4,"volume":55630.675},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":24.2,"high":25.85,"low":23.7,"close":24.6,"volume":29819.501999999997},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":24.75,"high":27.55,"low":23.75,"close":27.55,"volume":48674.3},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":28.05,"high":29.0,"low":25.35,"close":25.55,"volume":64892.271},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":25.55,"high":27.5,"low":24.4,"close":25.25,"volume":27335.15},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":25.0,"high":25.2